* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
# deploy/ and docker/ are read on Linux (docker01 and CI): the gate rejects a manifest with CR line ends, and sh rejects a CRLF script.
# deploy/* is the platform's scaffold line (ssh homelab contract scaffold gitattributes); docker/* and *.sh follow the same rule.
deploy/* text eol=lf
docker/* text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
